# ── Avery agent service · deploy env — TEMPLATE (committed, NO secrets) ───────────────────────────
# feat-018 (ADR-0021 §5) dual host. ONE image (eval-harness/Dockerfile), TWO targets, env-switched.
# Real keys live ONLY in the host's secret store / a gitignored eval-harness/.env — NEVER in git,
# NEVER in an image layer, NEVER toward the frontend (the frontend only ever sees SSE events).
#
# The service reads eval-harness/.env at import (avery.env.load_dotenv) AND real shell/host env wins.
# So in production you inject these via the host's env, not a committed file.
#
# ══ 1. BRAIN (pluggable — feat-015 service/brain_factory.py) ══════════════════════════════════════
#   AVERY_BRAIN selects the reasoning model. Keys are read by name per brain.
#     mock      deterministic, NO key — the AFK/offline default and CI gate.
#     minimax   境内 — MiniMax-M3        (needs MINIMAX_API_KEY)
#     deepseek  境内 — DeepSeek          (needs DEEPSEEK_API_KEY)
#     claude    海外 — claude-opus-4-8   (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
#     openai    欧盟/海外 — OpenAI gpt-5.6-terra (needs OPENAI_API_KEY) — #96
#               别名 `openai-compat` / `compat` 完全等价（/health 上一律归一显示成 `openai`）。
AVERY_BRAIN=mock

# 境内 (domestic) brain keys/endpoints — fill ONE family in the 境内 host's secret store.
#
# 🔴 2026-08-17 · DeepSeek 暂停（余额不足，Danny 暂不充值）。生产容器 env 里已拿掉
#    DEEPSEEK_API_KEY，境内现在是 **MiniMax 单家**：/health 的 extraction_chain 与 advise_chain
#    都是 ["minimax"]。代码零改动 —— 这两条链本来就是「谁有 key 谁进链」算出来的。
#    ⚠ 别用 AVERY_BRAIN_FAILOVER=off 来表达这件事：那是**全局** kill-switch，也是欧盟线的纪律位
#    （§6b 要求 EU 箱子必须 off），借它当「某一家没钱了」的开关会把这个 flag 的语义搞浑。
#    停一家就把那一家的 key 拿掉 —— 本仓的口径一贯是「『没有』而非『不用』」。
#    ⚠ 更别留一把没余额的 key：/health 会继续报热备 armed 而那条臂每次 402，是 #89 事故的翻版。
MINIMAX_API_KEY=
MINIMAX_BASE_URL=https://api.minimaxi.com/v1
MINIMAX_MODEL=MiniMax-M3
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat

# 海外 (overseas) brain key — fill in the overseas host's secret store.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ── #96 · OpenAI（欧盟/海外部署路径）─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPENAI_API_KEY=             # 只填这一个就够：下面每一项都有对的默认值。
#                             # 🔴 缺它时 AVERY_BRAIN=openai 会**干净报错**（不是静默落回），
#                             #    抽取则落 heuristic、embedding 落 keyword——都不会偷偷出网。
# AVERY_OPENAI_KEY_ENV=OPENAI_API_KEY   # 这台机器上 OPENAI_API_KEY 已被别的东西占用时改名字用
# AVERY_OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   # 默认即此。EU data residency 端点在这里换。
# AVERY_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6-terra           # advisor 位（难案子可升 gpt-5.6-sol）
# AVERY_OPENAI_EXTRACT_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna    # 抽取位（更省可换 gpt-5-nano）——与 advisor 分开配
# AVERY_OPENAI_REASONING_EFFORT=             # 空=不发这个参数。要压 reasoning token 成本拧这个，
#                                            # 别去砍输出上限（砍了会「全花在思考上、一个字没吐」）。
#   ⚠ 下面两个是给**第三方** OpenAI 兼容端点的逃生口，连 OpenAI 官方时别动：
# AVERY_OPENAI_TOKEN_PARAM=max_completion_tokens  # 只认老名字 max_tokens 的兼容端点改这里
# AVERY_OPENAI_TEMPERATURE=                       # 空=不发。OpenAI 推理模型收到显式温度直接 400
#
#   AVERY_ADVISE_TIMEOUT_S  (feat-028) per-CALL hard timeout for the /advise advisor brain (default
#                           180). Mirrors AVERY_EXTRACT_TIMEOUT_S — a hung/slow provider must not tie
#                           up the worker/threadpool for the ~600s SDK default. Ignored by mock.

# ══ 1b. EXTRACTION (pluggable — feat-023 service/extractor_factory.py, ADR-0022 §2) ═══════════════
#   AVERY_EXTRACTOR selects the /ingest extraction engine:
#     auto       (default) LLMExtractor when an extraction key exists, else heuristic
#     llm        LLMExtractor (still degrades to heuristic when keyless/failing)
#     heuristic  forced offline regexes — the AFK/CI gate pin
#   AVERY_EXTRACTOR_BRAIN  minimax (default when keyed) | deepseek | openai — 没指名时按这个顺序
#                          挑第一家有 key 的，所以给境内箱子加一把 OpenAI key 不会掉换主脑。
#                          brain_factory's `claude` is an unkeyed code path, never assumed here.
#   🔴 热备只在**同一地区家族内**发生（#96）：openai 与 minimax/deepseek 互不为对家。欧盟实例
#      的抽取绝不会 failover 到境内供应商，境内也不会溢到 OpenAI——这是第二把锁，第一把是
#      「欧盟 env 里根本没有中国 key」。
#   AVERY_EXTRACT_TIMEOUT_S  per-window hard timeout (default 240) — a stalled provider degrades
#                            to the heuristic instead of hanging the upload.
#   AVERY_INGEST_CONCURRENCY  (feat-027) how many documents extract in parallel per upload
#                            (default 4). Extraction fans out one blocking brain call per doc across
#                            a bounded thread pool, so a 10-file upload runs in ~max(one file) not
#                            ~sum. The cap is the rate-limit guardrail (a bursty fan-out tripped M3
#                            429s); set 1 to force the old sequential path.
AVERY_EXTRACTOR=auto

# ══ 2. RETRIEVAL + EMBEDDINGS (pluggable — feat-016 avery/ingest/store.py) ═════════════════════════
# The ingestion RAG is pluggable: keyword (offline/deterministic, the default + AFK gate) or vector
# (real embeddings + pgvector). Lite ships fine on keyword; vector is the production-quality path.
#   AVERY_EMBEDDINGS  dashscope | bailian | qwen | text-embedding-v4      → DashScope（境内）
#                     openai | text-embedding-3-small | text-embedding-3-large → OpenAI（欧盟/海外）
#                     （两组分别是 avery/embeddings.py 的 _DASHSCOPE_KINDS / _OPENAI_KINDS 全集，
#                       逐字照抄；别自己发明写法）
#                     其余一切值 → keyword（不设时的默认也是它）。
#                     🔴 落回是**静默**的：写错一个字母（包括本模板历史默认的 hashing）不报错、
#                     不告警，运维以为开了向量 RAG，实际拿到的是关键词检索。
# 真正走 keyword 还是 vector 由 prefer_vector = embedder is not None and registry.persistent 决定
# （出处 service/ingest_api.py:305、service/demo.py:119），不是靠这里的字符串直接切换。
AVERY_EMBEDDINGS=keyword

# 境内在跑的一家：DashScope（阿里云百炼）。生产实配 text-embedding-v4 / 1024 维。
# DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=          # 没有它，即使 AVERY_EMBEDDINGS=dashscope 也会 make_embedder 返回 None → 落回 keyword
#
# 欧盟/海外那一家（#96）：OpenAI text-embedding-3-small，**dimensions=1024**——正好落在既有的
# `avery.materials.embedding vector(1024)` 列上，所以换家不动 schema、不写迁移。key 复用上面
# §1 的 OPENAI_API_KEY（含 AVERY_OPENAI_KEY_ENV 改名、AVERY_OPENAI_BASE_URL 换端点）。
#
# AVERY_EMBED_MODEL=          # 🔴 这一对是**两家共用**的：换 provider 时若把上一家的模型名留在
# AVERY_EMBED_DIM=1024        #    这里（如 dashscope→openai 却仍写 text-embedding-v4），每一批
#                             #    请求都 404、检索静默落回 keyword。没有特别理由就两个都别设，
#                             #    默认值本来就是各家对的那一组。DIM 必须与列维度一致（1024）。
#
# 🔴 换 embedder ≠ 换个开关：两家的向量空间不兼容，**已有 context 的旧向量在换家之后是废的**
#    （余弦算出来是噪声），必须重嵌入。新库 / 新 context 无此问题。
#
# ⚠ 这里以前列过 BGE_API_KEY / VOYAGE_API_KEY 等占位（"when AVERY_EMBEDDINGS=voyage" 之类）。
#   voyage / bge-m3 / minimax **仍然不是合法 kind**，填了会静默落回 keyword。再接第三家，先改
#   avery/embeddings.py 的 kind 分支，再回来补这里。

# ══ 3. PERSISTENCE (feat-030 — Postgres/Supabase; ADR-0023-postgres) ══════════════════════════════
# Company workspaces (contexts + extraction entities + RAG chunks + materialized memory) persist in
# Postgres when a connection string is set — a restart/redeploy keeps every ingested company. Unset,
# the service falls back to the pre-030 in-memory registry (data dies with the process; offline/dev).
# Schema: everything under the dedicated `avery` schema (db/migrations/0001_avery_persistence.sql;
# bootstrapped idempotently on first use). Supabase: use the project's pooled connection string.
#   AVERY_DB_URL is the primary name; PGVECTOR_URL is accepted as an alias (feat-031 fills the
#   reserved embedding column over the SAME database, so one URL serves both).
# AVERY_DB_URL=postgresql://postgres:CHANGEME@db.PROJECT.supabase.co:5432/postgres   # host secret store, NEVER committed
# PGVECTOR_URL=postgresql://avery:CHANGEME@localhost:5432/avery   # alias, same semantics
# Where materialized memory (facts.md/notes.md) lands on local disk. With a DB configured this is a
# rebuildable cache (re-materialized from Postgres on demand); default is the OS temp dir.
# AVERY_DATA_DIR=/var/lib/avery/contexts

# ══ 4. SERVICE RUNTIME ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PORT=8137
# CORS: the deployed frontend origins that may call this service (browser fetch). Comma-separated.
# The CORS middleware is ALWAYS ON (service/app.py) — it is NOT a follow-up. Unset, it falls back to
# the localhost dev origins below, which BLOCKS a deployed browser frontend. In production SET this
# to the real frontend origin(s). NOTE: a Vercel (HTTPS) frontend needs an HTTPS backend — an HTTP
# backend is mixed-content and browsers hard-block it (put TLS / a reverse proxy in front, or serve
# same-origin). See docs/deploy/dual-deploy-runbook.md §C.
# AVERY_CORS_ORIGINS=https://avery.example.com,https://avery.example.cn
# Default when unset: http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173  (Vite dev only)

# ══ 5. UPLOAD HARD-GATE + SPEND/MEMORY GUARDS (feat-039) ══════════════════════════════════════════
# ALL opt-in (defaults keep the offline suite green). In PRODUCTION set the bold ones — unset = open.
#   AVERY_RATE_INGEST_PER_MIN   ** SET IT ** — per-IP /ingest rate limit. 0 (default) = NO limit (a
#                               flood on the memory-tight box). Pair with AVERY_TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS.
#   AVERY_RATE_INGEST_BURST     token-bucket burst (default = per-min, or 1).
#   AVERY_RATE_ADVISE_PER_MIN / AVERY_RATE_ADVISE_BURST   same limiter on /advise (default off).
#   AVERY_LLM_CALL_BUDGET       ** SET IT ** — per-process LLM-call ceiling (denial-of-wallet). 0
#                               (default) = UNLIMITED. Counts EVERY chat-model call: the /advise
#                               agentic loop (up to 12 calls/turn — brought into the gate after the
#                               0805 walkthrough found it uncovered), extraction, /ask drafting.
#                               Exhausted => extraction degrades to heuristic, /advise returns an
#                               honest error event; never silently burns tokens.
#   AVERY_EMBED_CALL_BUDGET     per-process ceiling on billable DashScope embedding BATCHES (<=10
#                               texts each), on its own counter (/health embed_calls_remaining) —
#                               embeddings are ~2 orders cheaper than a chat call, so they don't
#                               share the LLM number. 0 (default) = UNLIMITED. Exhausted =>
#                               retrieval/ingest degrade to keyword, uploads still land.
#   AVERY_TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS    ** SET =1 behind nginx ** — the real client is the Nth XFF hop FROM
#                               THE RIGHT. 0 (default) trusts ONLY the TCP peer (spoof-proof). With
#                               the nginx REPLACE recipe (proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For
#                               $remote_addr) there is one hop => 1. Mispairing = bypass or over-strict.
#   AVERY_MEM_WARN_MB           RSS high-water mark (MiB) -> WARN log + /health degraded (Danny Q12
#                               "upsize the ECS" bubble-up). Unset = sentinel inert. Set ~= --memory cap.
#   AVERY_MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES              per-FILE cap (default 8 MiB) -> 413.
#   AVERY_MAX_TOTAL_UPLOAD_BYTES        per-REQUEST total-body cap (default 32 MiB) -> 413 before RAM.
#   AVERY_MAX_FILES                     per-request file count (default 15) -> 413.
#   AVERY_MAX_PDF_PAGES (500) / AVERY_MAX_ARCHIVE_UNCOMPRESSED_BYTES (100 MiB) / AVERY_MAX_ARCHIVE_ENTRIES (4096)
#                               PDF-page + zip-bomb caps. NB defaults were sized for a ~540M box; the
#                               prod box has ~150M free — LOWER the total/archive caps accordingly.
# AVERY_RATE_INGEST_PER_MIN=20
# AVERY_LLM_CALL_BUDGET=2000
# AVERY_TRUSTED_PROXY_HOPS=1
# AVERY_MEM_WARN_MB=420

# ══ 6b. 🇪🇺 欧盟实例隔离纪律 (#96) ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 一台欧盟实例的 env 是「哪些**没有**」定义的，不只是「哪些有」。全文在
# docs/deploy/dual-deploy-runbook.md §1「欧盟 EU (OpenAI)」那一列，这里是清单：
#   1. 不放 MINIMAX_API_KEY / DEEPSEEK_API_KEY / DASHSCOPE_API_KEY —— 「没有」而非「不用」，
#      答尽调才硬（代码里的 region 闸是第二把锁，不是第一把）。
#   2. AVERY_BRAIN_FAILOVER=off —— OpenAI 没有指定的第二家；且绝不允许 failover 回中国供应商。
#   3. AVERY_ALLOW_PERSON_SCORING=0 —— AI Act Annex III 4(b)（performance evaluation）定性边界。
#   4. 花钱闸照配：AVERY_LLM_CALL_BUDGET / AVERY_EMBED_CALL_BUDGET（见 §5）。
# 核对方式：起来后打 /health，`brain` 应为 openai、`extraction_chain` 应为 ["openai"] 单家、
# `embeddings` 应为 openai:text-embedding-3-small/1024。出现任何 minimax/deepseek/dashscope 字样
# 就是这台机器上还留着中国 provider 的配置。

# ══ 6. POLICY — person scoring (feat-033 pivot, 2026-07-13) ═══════════════════════════════════════
# Default OFF = the shipped moat: person-scoring extractions/notes are hard-blocked (red line). The
# 2026-07-13 pivot lets real companies run the UNBLOCKED build. Truthy = 1/true/yes/on; a typo fails
# CLOSED (keeps blocking). The detector is untouched — only the enforcement raise is skipped when on.
# AVERY_ALLOW_PERSON_SCORING=1
